  "question": {
    "text": "A particle of mass 2 kg is on a smooth horizontal table and moves in a circular path of radius 0.6 m . The height of the table from the ground is 0.8 m . If the angular speed of the particle is $12 \\mathrm{rad} \\mathrm{s}^{-1}$, the magnitude of its angular momentum about a point on the ground right under the centre of the circle is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "N3Qxj",
      "text": "$14.4 \\mathrm{~kg} \\mathrm{~m}^2 \\mathrm{~s}^{-1}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "6lYvS",
      "text": "$8.64 \\mathrm{~kg} \\mathrm{~m}^2 \\mathrm{~s}^{-1}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "UHqbN",
      "text": "$20.16 \\mathrm{~kg} \\mathrm{~m}^2 \\mathrm{~s}^{-1}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "sPpsP",
      "text": "$11.52 \\mathrm{~kg} \\mathrm{~m}^2 \\mathrm{~s}^{-1}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Angular momentum\n$L_0=\\mathrm{mvr} \\sin 90^{\\circ}$\n$=2 \\times 0.6 \\times 12 \\times 1 \\times 1$\n$\\left[\\right.$ As $V=r \\omega$, $\\left.\\operatorname{Sin} 90^{\\circ}=1\\right]$\nSo, $L_0=14.4 \\mathrm{kgm}^2 / \\mathrm{s}$\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/4xggfJwA6Ye2Jn0aw5Wa11vWR9MlRgOmeyJVuGXEx0E.original.fullsize.png\"/><br/>",
